 .IR rtc (3)).
 With option
+.BR -s ,
+.I keyfs
+also posts the same connection at
+.BI /srv/ srv
+before mounting it.
+Only the host owner may publish this service; its file is owned by the
+host owner with mode 0600.  Other host-owner namespaces may mount this
+service at
+.BR /mnt/keys ,
+without starting another keyfs or reopening the database.
+The service file is the access boundary: keyfs does not authenticate attaches.
+No service is published by default.
+.PP
